{"name":"My Love","hex":"#e1c6a8","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"love","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A deep caring for the existence of another.","Strong affection."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To have a strong affection for (someone or something).","To need, thrive on."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/love"}],"entries":[{"title":"My Love (Engelbert Humperdinck album)","blocks":[{"text":"My Love is a studio album by British singer Engelbert Humperdinck, released in 1973 on Decca Records in the United Kingdom, and on Parrot Records in the United States and Canada."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/04/My_Love_%28Engelbert_Humperdinck_album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Love_(Engelbert_Humperdinck_album)"},{"title":"My Love (Paul McCartney and Wings song)","blocks":[{"text":"\"My Love\" is a song by the British–American band Paul McCartney and Wings that was first released as the lead single from their 1973 album Red Rose Speedway. It was written by Paul McCartney as a love song to his wife and Wings bandmate Linda. The single marked the first time that McCartney's name appeared in the artist credit for a Wings record, after their previous releases had been credited to Wings alone. Released on 23 March 1973, the song topped the Billboard Hot 100 chart in the US for four weeks and peaked at number 9 on the UK Singles Chart. The single was viewed as Wings' first significant success in the US and helped Red Rose Speedway achieve commercial success."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/48/%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Love_(Paul_McCartney_and_Wings_song)"},{"title":"Love","blocks":[{"text":"Love encompasses a range of strong and positive emotional and mental states, from the most sublime virtue or good habit, the deepest interpersonal affection, to the simplest pleasure. An example of this range of meanings is that the love of a mother differs from the love of a spouse, which differs from the love for food. Most commonly, love refers to a feeling of strong attraction and emotional attachment."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Love"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/04/My_Love_%28Engelbert_Humperdinck_album%29.jpg/250px-My_Love_%28Engelbert_Humperdinck_album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/04/My_Love_%28Engelbert_Humperdinck_album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/0/04/My_Love_%28Engelbert_Humperdinck_album%29.jpg/250px-My_Love_%28Engelbert_Humperdinck_album%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMy_Love_(Engelbert_Humperdinck_album).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/48/%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg/250px-%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/48/%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/48/%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg/250px-%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3A%22My_Love%22_1973_Italian_picture_sleeve.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Columpio_Veracruz_059.jpg/500px-Columpi